# What no image needs. Two of the three build contexts are the repository root, so
# without this a local build copies in whatever a checkout has been used for --
# a virtualenv alone is hundreds of megabytes, and it would shadow the one uv
# installs.
.git
.claude
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/target
**/logs
**/dbt_packages
